      "created_at": "2018-09-13T15:25:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Perhaps in 'villains' mode? Not all of them, obviously, and for balance you could have them start at 1/2 HP (rounding down). So a 50 HP Scion would be a 25 HP villain.</p>\n<p>I can see Aeon Master, Empyreon, Dark Mind, Faultless, Noxious the Chosen (although he'll never flip) being usable. A lot of the scion deck won't be usable though. Perhaps you could mix it with the Aeon men deck?&nbsp;</p>",
