      "name": "bobbertoriley",
      "username": "bobbertoriley",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bobbertoriley/{size}/1910_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-13T15:49:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The only experiment I did during playtesting (early on) was subsitute OblivAeon with two villains across battle zones to simulate the experience. (Possibly substituting one villain for (H)-1 or (H)-2 team villains). I don't remember all the rules, and OblivAeon changed a lot in development that things like missions wouldn't work well in this format, but I plan to revisit the idea at some point.</p>",
