    {
      "id": 222172,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-13T19:41:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was hoping something like this would work, but so many cards in the scion deck use OblivAeon-specific mechanics, not to mention the scions themselves.&nbsp; It would be tricky.</p>\n<p>Now, you could possibly use Vengeance villains as Scions more easily.&nbsp; Most of them seem about on par with difficulty 1 or 2 scions, although if their incaps never went away, that would add a whole other level of challenge.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:02.947Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
