      "id": 222173,
      "name": "Legend of Ruina",
      "username": "Joebobjoe",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/dec6dc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-13T21:40:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Incaps become their rewards, you simply drag them through a Hall of Mirrors so that they swap Hero and Villain. A few might need further reworking (Capitan, and Ambuscade come to mind), but it basically exchanges the slightly larger dead Scion reward for a persistent bonus to one battle zone.</p>",
